<title>UK: Unibanco sets $150 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Unibanco sets $150 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg and Unibanco.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIBANCO SA GRAND CAYMAN BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    06.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  L 05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+190 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMS US/UK/CY/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR US TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF A $2.0 BILLION MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
